WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.060
Social Studies Prep Room

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.760
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:36.420
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:41.200
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.710
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:48.240
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.110
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:56.350
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.720
Maria Watches Over Us

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:12.090
Spreading a blank map wide open
Shiroi chizu ookiku hiroge

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.110
Let's go hide the treasure box
Takara-bako kakushi ni ikou

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:27.180
No need for coats or even hats
Kooto nante iranai boushi mo ne

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:34.810
Armed with just mechanical pencil lead
Shaapen no shin dake haite

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:38.230
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:42.130
Running through
kakenukeru

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.100
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:50.060
Our footprints mark the X
ashiato wa batsu-jirushi da yo

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:57.080
Passing through the walls of the school
Kousha no kabe tsuki-nuke

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:05.320
We can go anywhere, there will be a path there
Dokonimo ikeru soko ni michi ga aru

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:12.520
The pleats of our skirts won't be disturbed
Sukaato no hida midare-nai

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:19.860
If it's a secret journey
Himitsu no tabi nara

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.370
There are now 5 minutes left.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.550
What? What shall we do?

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.340
Yes...

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.180
At this rate, the privilege will
go to the Absentee Chance?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:40.610
Yumi.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.210
Y-Yes?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.600
Stand up.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:00.900
Pardon?

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.600
Just stand up.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.060
Yumi-sama!

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.620
Toko-chan!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.470
Yumi-sama,

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.640
please forgive me for the many times
I have shown you rudeness!

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:37.880
What?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.270
And having said that...

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.410
Might you not...

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.650
...make me your little sister?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:05.870
In Search of You

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.650
It is now 4:40.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.020
The search time is over,

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:24.490
so we ask that all students
participating in the treasure hunt...

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.460
...gather in the inner courtyard.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.530
Oh, um, you should all hurry outside as well.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.130
It's over...

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.410
So we just need to take these?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:37.670
Wait a minute.
So we just need to take these?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.430
Wait a minute.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.510
I just want to check with you quickly,

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.310
but what do you intend to do with the red card?

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.610
What? Uh...

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.550
It belongs to Toko-chan, right?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.280
But Rosa Chinensis...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.620
I have no right to it.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:55.080
Certainly, I told Yumi to stand up,

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.530
but it was Toko-chan who actually
made Yumi come to her feet.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.400
In that case, please give the
red card to Matsudaira-san.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.270
All right.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.430
Toko-chan.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.550
We will now announce the results!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.760
As scheduled, after the
hour of search time was up,

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.100
Mami-san announced what became of the cards.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:44.840
Shimako-san's white card was
hidden under a teacher's car,

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.010
and in the end, no one found it,

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.540
so it was determined that a correct answer...

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.740
...would be found from among
the Absentee Chance forms.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.650
Tanuma Chisato-san got the yellow
card for the second year in a row...

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.620
...and Toko-chan was declared
the winner of the red card.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:02.380
Thanks for coming.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.590
To all the students who did not find a card,

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:09.530
we passed out bite-sized chocolates
as a prize for participation.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.170
Thus, the Valentine's event,

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:14.600
the Treasure Hunt Competition
of the Future Lady Roses...

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.540
...ended without mishap, but...

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.050
By the way, what's going on?

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.170
"What's going on?"

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.840
What happened after that?

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:27.740
With Toko-chan?

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:28.720
Yes.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.290
She hasn't called you or
discussed the date with you?

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.550
Oh, there haven't been any real developments.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.320
I see.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:36.410
Just you wait.

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.260
I'll run over and bring Toko-chan to you.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.160
Wait!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:44.930
But... my getting involved will only
complicate things further, huh?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:45.890
Yeah.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.000
Um, about Toko...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.490
It seems she is here at school,
but I didn't see her in the classroom.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.680
This has turned into quite a commotion, after all.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.850
I ended up being besieged by everyone as well.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.250
I guess it's become pretty big news.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.010
Yes.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:04.250
It might be better to quickly
give the rosary to her...

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.550
...and officially become soeurs with her.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.330
Oh...

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.570
I finally found you.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.170
Good day.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.650
I've been looking for you, Toko-chan.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:37.750
I was peeking in on the Drama Club's
rehearsal in the gymnasium...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.550
...and they told me you'd probably be here.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.420
This is about the date, right?

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:42.960
From the Valentine's event?

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.360
Yes, well...

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.630
How about Sunday the week after next?

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.430
That day would be fine.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.160
Is there anywhere you want to go?

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.370
You're fine with any place I want to go?

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.830
Of course.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.040
As long as we can get there and
back in a day and within budget.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.270
Here, these are the rules for the date.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:08.080
The budget is 2000 yen per person...

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:12.580
When you consider the cost of lunch,
you cannot go very far...

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:14.990
But if we can get there with our rail passes,

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.330
we can each enjoy a 2000 yen lunch.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.850
Oh, that's true.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:26.100
I need to talk to her properly.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:32.340
To...

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:32.570
Toko-chan!
To...

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.160
Toko-chan!

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.780
Oh, I'm sorry, I'm interrupting your conversation.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.720
It must be cold out there.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.770
If you would like, please come on inside.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.880
Oh, no, I'm sorry for interrupting
your club activities.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.790
I'll be leaving shortly.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:48.580
Really?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.880
But you needn't be so concerned.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:53.620
It's just the two of us here anyway.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.120
Well, then...

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.290
Oh, okay...

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.300
Um, Yumi-sama?

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.340
What is it?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:08.240
I would like to ask for your answer after the date...

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:08.970
What?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.440
Oh...

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.630
Good day.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.860
Good day.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.000
I'm so glad.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:36.590
Pardon?

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:39.570
I mean, you said it was a mystery tour...

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.940
...and wouldn't tell me where we were going.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.970
I agonized a lot about what I should wear.

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.620
Then, shall we go?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:48.170
Okay.

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:49.650
Huh?

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:50.980
W-What?

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.440
We will be taking a bus first.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.460
We took the bus,

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.700
got off at a private rail line station,

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:13.200
and from there, we took a train and
then transferred at another station.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.370
Here you are.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:18.570
Thank you.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.520
The mystery tour that Toko-chan
had planned out...

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:25.210
...took us farther and farther away from Tokyo.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:32.960
But...

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.730
...during all this time,

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.390
Toko-chan remained quiet.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.470
When I said I would take
over the hospital business,

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.200
it delighted my grandfather very much.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.370
What?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.270
Though, that was a long time ago.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.540
By hospital, you mean your grandfather's, right?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.640
Yes. On my father's side.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.050
But my father did not become a doctor,

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.620
even though he was the only child.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.310
And that's why you said that?

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.420
It is a small hospital,

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:05.260
but it is beloved by the
local people and the patients,

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.290
so I absolutely didn't want
to see it closed down.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.630
But my grandfather has stated
he will retire in 3 years.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.300
Then, what about the hospital?

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:20.200
It seems it will be left to the couple
who is currently helping him.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:25.610
No one had taken me seriously when
I said I would take over the hospital.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:31.120
In 3 years, I will barely have managed
to graduate from high school...

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.310
...and I will still be far from
getting my medical license.

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:37.160
I considered marrying a doctor,
but they were against it.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:40.250
They told me it was ridiculous
to marry for the hospital.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:45.870
I thought that they no longer needed me.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.240
They had found an immediate replacement,

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.430
so I believed they no longer found me useful.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.210
And so, I ran away from home.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.240
Then, that day...

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.150
Yes.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.380
I'm sorry, I don't really understand...

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:12.220
...why you're so intent on
taking over the hospital.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.620
Is it unfathomable for you?

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.130
Do you not trust the people
who'll be taking over?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.840
No, they are very good people.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:21.730
Then...

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:25.310
The idea of becoming the
Matsudaira family successor...

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.330
...had become the foundation of my life.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:29.570
Why?

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.210
Little by little, I'm getting closer to Toko-chan.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.190
What awaits me at the end of this journey...

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.560
...is sure to be Toko-chan's heart.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.740
Yumi-sama! Yumi-sama!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.900
Over here!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.980
The Matsudaira Hospital at
the Foot of the Mountains

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.280
They have a shuttle bus.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.480
Since my grandfather's hospital
is far from the train station.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.450
Now, really! Take your shoes off.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:31.270
Pulling out of the station,
the bus left behind the populated area...

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:33.300
...and headed for country roads.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.110
It's almost time for lunch.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.950
If I take out the cost of the return trip,

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:43.110
I guess that leaves about 600 yen between us.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.450
I wonder if there are any convenience
stores near the hospital.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:47.680
Are you hungry?

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.590
Oh, uh, well...

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.490
Please wait just a little longer.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:55.660
What am I thinking at a time like this?

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.600
My mother is in this picture.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.600
Is that her?

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.210
Yes, it is.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.400
This is my mother.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.810
The Matsudaira
Hospital at the
Foot of the
Mountains

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:28.820
It's delicious.

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:31.260
I am so glad it is to your taste.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.930
I see, the hospital's cafeteria!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.060
Here, we can eat and stay within our budget.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.690
Ah! Toko!

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.540
Grandfather!

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:48.140
I had heard that you were coming,
but I was on a house call.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:50.070
You're looking well.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:56.590
So, you made trouble for your mom
and dad by running away from home?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.230
Good for you!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.660
Oh, Grandfather, that was last year.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:02.490
This is my grandfather.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:07.160
This is Fukuzawa Yumi-sama,
an upperclassman from my school.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.390
It is nice to meet you.

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:10.910
Yumi-san, is it?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.400
Might you be Sachiko-san's?

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.900
You know of her?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:17.810
Yes, because Saiko-san
often spoke of her to me.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.970
Sachiko-sama's grandmother did?

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.910
I see, so you're Yumi-san!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:28.360
I hope you will bear with Toko.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.980
Please make sure you really
put her through her paces.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.430
Yes, sir.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.090
Ah, Doctor.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.420
Hello there, Hashimoto-san.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:40.230
In the end, I was being small.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:41.430
What do you mean?

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.300
Noriko once told me so, too.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:49.000
That I could not see the larger picture,
because I was in a small place.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:51.510
Oh, Miss.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.850
Hello, I didn't know you were here.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:54.810
Hello.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:56.380
Please make yourself at home.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.850
Thank you very much.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.590
So you come out this way often.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:01.210
Yes.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:11.320
How adorable.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.460
Shall we go?

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:26.440
Sixteen years ago, there was a car accident.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.680
It was on a gentle, downward-sloping curve.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:34.350
A truck veered into the opposing lane
and struck a passenger vehicle.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:38.530
There was a young married couple
in the passenger vehicle,

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.860
and they passed away due to the accident.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.370
I do not know the exact location,

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.360
but I believe it was somewhere around here.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.540
In the infant safety seat of the passenger vehicle,

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.510
there was a sleeping newborn baby.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.950
That child alone survived unscathed.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.480
About as old as the baby we saw earlier...

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:06.790
No, it was about a month after my birth,

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.880
so I must have been even smaller.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.420
The sole, surviving baby...

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.070
That child was me.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.710
I... lost my parents in one fell swoop...

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.710
That's enough already.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.340
No, please listen.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.450
Having lost my parents,

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.910
the only family I had was my elderly
grandmother on my father's side.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.920
And she was hospitalized here,

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.360
so she was hardly in a position to raise me...

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:53.090
...and it was determined that
I would go to an orphanage.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.200
But right before that happened,

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.070
the Matsudairas took me in and raised me.

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:09.480
And my Matsudaira mother is her.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.420
And this...

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.920
This is the woman who gave birth to me...

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.680
Then...

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.520
I guess there are such things as coincidences.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.790
The two were classmates in high school.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:28.390
It is only recently that I learned this.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:34.800
But I have known for quite some time
that I am not the Matsudairas' child.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:39.010
Overhearing the conversations
of insensitive adults,

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.110
I had my suspicions.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.120
Once I became somewhat wise
to the ways of the world,

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.020
I only had to look at the family register to know.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:51.620
My birth mother apparently performed
with a small theatrical company.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.550
When I learned of that,
I even thought about quitting theatre.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:01.560
But if I quit abruptly, I thought my
parents might read too much into it.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.540
I love my current parents very much.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.370
But I have ended up hurting them.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:15.150
We couldn't agree regarding
the hospital and I yelled at them,

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.670
"So you don't need me anymore?!"

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:23.920
But until that moment, my parents
hadn't even realized that I knew...

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:27.690
Why have you told me all this?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.200
I want you to know everything
about me, Yumi-sama.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.870
This is what Kashiwagi-san was talking about...

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.370
Toko-chan's secret.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.790
I used to hate you, Yumi-sama.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:08.500
You were so sunny and artless
and you had everything.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:12.600
It was as though you had no dark,
ugly side to you at all.

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:15.340
Please, I have as much of a dark,
ugly side to me as anyone.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:17.300
I know that now.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:18.340
Oh, really.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.080
I probably wanted to be like you.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.380
But I could not be like you.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.090
I even thought it would be better
not to be around you anymore,

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:32.860
but even as I desperately put up walls,

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.990
you kept coming, tearing them all down.

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.860
Don't talk about me like I'm some giant monster.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.460
But it's the truth.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:45.270
In time, rumors even surfaced that I was
a candidate for your little sister.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:49.840
I continually did things that
would make you hate me...

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:52.280
...and I believed I could
never be your little sister.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:55.550
But even as I desperately denied
the possibility in my heart,

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:59.350
my feelings defied me and grew for you.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:02.320
That was why I kept running away...

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:08.660
And yet, out of the blue,
you asked me to be your little sister.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.100
I'm sorry.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.610
I hope you'll pour your heart out to me...

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:28.780
...about all the things you've kept
silent about and bottled up inside.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:32.240
I'll listen to you grumble
for as long as you need.

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:36.220
Because we...

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.590
...are to become soeurs.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.560
Once you get it all out of your system,

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:47.230
we'll next turn to filling that empty
space with happy memories.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.330
Just as I've done with Sachiko-sama.

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.580
Wait just a little longer.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:06.540
Tomorrow, we'll go to school,

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:08.150
and then...

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:47.760
A winterscape where even...
Machi no irodori sae doko

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:52.530
...the town's colors seem forlorn somehow
to naku samishige na fuyu no keshiki

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:56.540
I think of you, turning your back on me...
Senaka mise kaketeitta

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:00.270
...and running off
anata o omou

00:23:01.210 --> 00:23:05.250
There's a clear square pane...
Futari no aida ni wa

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:09.250
...between the two of us
toumei na shikakkei

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:12.020
It's misted over right now...
Ima wa kasunderu

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:18.620
...with the crystals of sighs
tame-iki no kesshou de

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:23.260
Window glass, window glass
Mado garasu mado garasu

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:29.240
It's clouded and I can't see you
Kumottete anata ga mienai no

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:35.040
Even though I know that you're there
Soko ni iru koto wa wakatteiru no ni

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:39.180
Are you smiling? Are you crying?
Waratteru naiteru no

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:45.190
I don't even care if you're frowning, let me see you
Shikamettsura demo ii kara misete

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:53.650
Wipe the glass from your side, too
Sochira no hou kara mo garasu o fuite
